dist
.easignore

# Do NOT add web-assets/ here. It is the staged web bundle that
# scripts/stage-web-assets.mjs produces and the Android build copies into
# app/src/main/assets. When .easignore exists it replaces .gitignore for the EAS
# upload entirely, so anything listed here is silently absent on the build server --
# which would produce an APK with a black WebView that still passes the smoke test.
